t um somebody told me that mark told  them what was on it and i don't even  remember what it was because i don't  believe them i don't know why  i just like found that too hard to  believe but martin never told me what it  was  so i guess that goes back to him being  so  careful with actors and not wanting to  get in their head or get in their way  uh what do you think allen wanted to  tell michael i firmly believe  is is a full mystery and  michael says he's like i don't know  maybe it was about fran  maybe it was about something else and  you know the more i've thought about  that i think  in some ways alan is a character  for all the things he may or may not  mean one of the things is that  he exemplifies that that old saying of  everybody's going through something  and whether he's struggling with his  sexuality  or whether he was just leaving his wife  or whether it's something else  he is clearly hurting and um  and it leads him to a to this gathering  where he is then  lashes out and is hurtful to other  people and his old friend lashes out and  is hurtful back to him  um and i think it's just that that thing  of like  you just you never know for sure what's  going on with anybody  um and to be empathetic and try to be  understanding  for their for who they are because of  that  on that note i have to go i'm just going  to say i really mean it you did a  fantastic job with the material  thank you so much for giving me your  time thank you very much

